 odels for cultural and creative actors\, with example topics including new
  media\, digital art\, AI and blockchain tools\, 3D scanning and digital a
 rchives.\n\nOrganisation: Istanbul Development Agency (ISTKA)\nLocation: I
 stanbul\, Turkiye. Lead applicants must be legal entities registered or he
