 idency in Nicosia\, Cyprus. The residency supports site-specific experimen
 tation\, community engagement and public showcases\, with the aim of an ar
 tist-led regeneration of the Walled City of Nicosia and a focus on practic
 es relevant to post-conflict contexts.\n\nOrganisation: Visual Voices (MON
