 osia\, Cyprus (in-person\, shared accommodation)\nAward: EUR 6\,000 artist
  fee per artist\, plus EUR 1\,400 production costs\, travel (EUR 600-1\,00
 0) and shared accommodation. Two artists selected. No application fee stat
 ed.\nDuration: 6 months\, February to July 2027.\n\nMore: https://monart-5
